msgctxt "268"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Get at least 3,000 points in a Hard Game!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz! Fai almeno 2.600 punti in una partita Difficile!"

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"(At least 3,000 points in a Hard Game... One play is 300 yen. Should I give "
"it a try?)"
msgstr ""
"(Almeno 2.600 punti in una partita Difficile... Una giocata costa 300 yen. "
"Ci provo?)"

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Okay, I'll give it a try."
msgstr "Va bene, ci provo."

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Buona fortuna, zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "328"
msgid "(No, maybe not.)"
msgstr "(O forse no.)"

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Aww! You should play!"
msgstr "Dai! Dovresti giocare!"

msgctxt "352"
msgid "(One Hard Game is 300 yen, but I don't have enough cash...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Aww! You should play!"
msgstr "Dai! Dovresti giocare!"

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"In this game, there are bingo squares numbered 1 through 9. Hit balls to "
"form a line of numbers down, across, or diagonally to score points."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"You can also hit two targets at once by hitting a ball between two adjacent "
"targets. However, the center target, number 5, has a steel frame around it "
"that prevents it from being hit at the same time as another target."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Once you hit all the targets, a bonus target will appear. However, you only "
"get one chance to hit it. The bonus target disappears after one pitch, "
"whether you hit it or not. Go for a new high score by hitting all the "
"numbers down, across, and diagonally!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "(Hmm... The Hard Game is 300 yen. Maybe I should give it a try.)"
msgstr ""
"(Mmm... Il Gioco Difficile costa 300 yen. Magari ci faccio un tentativo.)"

